              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="5">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Draws a wind case's residual convergence directly on the Grasshopper canvas, with lightweight timed updates. Wire the case and toggle 'Live' to monitor a running simulation without an external plotter window. When a warm-up ramp is enabled the solver restarts mid-run and writes a separate residual file per phase; all phases are stitched into one continuous curve so you see the full history (warm-up + main), not just the latest phase.

Version 1.6.0.827</item>
                    <item name="DirectionDegrees" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">-1</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">d1cca42f-7eaa-4217-b772-3efbbdb439cb</item>
